WEBVTT

00:02.600 --> 00:04.040
Everyone pitched him.

00:05.950 --> 00:06.970
You listened.

00:07.500 --> 00:08.570
One note.

00:11.400 --> 00:12.760
He kept your card.

00:17.300 --> 00:19.080
You were already prepared.

00:20.600 --> 00:21.620
He booked.

00:23.600 --> 00:25.400
Be the one they call back.
